contentText:
With well over two decades of experience, 50 Cent is well-versed in all things beef. Appearing on The Crew Has It podcast on Tuesday (Oct. 13), 50 explained his belief that J. Cole lost the most by dodging the Kendrick Lamar and Drake battle in 2024.

&#8220;I think it&#8217;s a part of hip-hop culture to compete,&#8221; 50 told host Andrew Schulz. &#8220;The mistake is when you opt out of the competition. I think J. Cole paid the most.&#8221;

